"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l027","ordinal":314529,"en":"Dark blood flowed where she clawed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l028","ordinal":314530,"en":"And all strength left your sister-in-law."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l029","ordinal":314531,"en":"Her gray pacer went ambling on,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l030","ordinal":314532,"en":"While the blood streaming down both cheeks"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l031","ordinal":314533,"en":"Flowed over the gray pacer’s mane,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l032","ordinal":314534,"en":"Running down a whip-length."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l033","ordinal":314535,"en":"Overcome by grievous affliction,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l034","ordinal":314536,"en":"She threw herself down when she saw him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l035","ordinal":314537,"en":"Shrieking at the sight of Buurul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l036","ordinal":314538,"en":"Poor Aichürök"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l037","ordinal":314539,"en":"Fell down as though dead."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l038","ordinal":314540,"en":"She had settled at the cliffside camp,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l039","ordinal":314541,"en":"Bereft of her noble-hearted lord,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l040","ordinal":314542,"en":"And had come to bear a wretched name."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l001","ordinal":314543,"en":"Before my lion-hearted father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l002","ordinal":314544,"en":"If only I might die as a sacrifice!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l003","ordinal":314545,"en":"When even a beast grieves like this,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l004","ordinal":314546,"en":"I am human—I am his son;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l005","ordinal":314547,"en":"How can I endure it,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l006","ordinal":314548,"en":"When the beast comes neighing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l007","ordinal":314549,"en":"Lamenting thunderously beneath me?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l008","ordinal":314550,"en":"The beast spoke a word"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l009","ordinal":314551,"en":"That said, “Let my noble father not be dead.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l010","ordinal":314552,"en":"It drove a thought into my breast:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l011","ordinal":314553,"en":"“If my lion-hearted father were alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l012","ordinal":314554,"en":"Leading the way and fighting foes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l013","ordinal":314555,"en":"If my bloodthirsty father were here,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l014","ordinal":314556,"en":"I would don my chain-mail cap"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l015","ordinal":314557,"en":"And strike the enemy head-on."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l016","ordinal":314558,"en":"With my noble, lion-hearted father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l017","ordinal":314559,"en":"I did not die as his companion;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l018","ordinal":314560,"en":"I did not crush the approaching enemy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l019","ordinal":314561,"en":"Nor tear them limb from limb."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l020","ordinal":314562,"en":"My precious heroic father’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l021","ordinal":314563,"en":"Robe worn on ceremonial occasions—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l022","ordinal":314564,"en":"I did not put on that bulletproof coat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l023","ordinal":314565,"en":"If my dear father were alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l024","ordinal":314566,"en":"I would ask for and mount my Buurul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l025","ordinal":314567,"en":"The steed no bullet could reach,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l026","ordinal":314568,"en":"And charge the foe with a battle cry."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l027","ordinal":314569,"en":"With my lion-hearted father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l028","ordinal":314570,"en":"I never rode as his companion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l029","ordinal":314571,"en":"I am left an ill-fated orphan;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l030","ordinal":314572,"en":"My leopard of a father, come and take me."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l031","ordinal":314573,"en":"Your beast stands neighing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l032","ordinal":314574,"en":"Your orphan stands crying aloud."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l033","ordinal":314575,"en":"My father is gone—what cruel fate!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l034","ordinal":314576,"en":"My devastated father, to whom all twelve"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l035","ordinal":314577,"en":"Pledged their united allegiance, come and take me!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l036","ordinal":314578,"en":"Saying, “My sole beast left from the host,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l037","ordinal":314579,"en":"And, “Though a beast, he is my very soul,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l038","ordinal":314580,"en":"He pressed his face to the horse’s chest,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l039","ordinal":314581,"en":"Grasped its forelock and sniffed it sorrowfully,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l040","ordinal":314582,"en":"And clasped the noble steed in his arms."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l001","ordinal":314583,"en":"Unable to take his tiny life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l002","ordinal":314584,"en":"His grief and humiliation"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l003","ordinal":314585,"en":"The bloodthirsty warrior’s son, brave Seytek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l004","ordinal":314586,"en":"Could not master with courage;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l005","ordinal":314587,"en":"“Restrain your grief."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l006","ordinal":314588,"en":"Before the spoken words could be gathered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l007","ordinal":314589,"en":"Before anyone could say, ‘What is it?’"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l008","ordinal":314590,"en":"In the blink of an eye,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l009","ordinal":314591,"en":"Sixty mighty caravan men,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l010","ordinal":314592,"en":"Those fiends who stole horses,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l011","ordinal":314593,"en":"Their shouts loud enough to split stone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l012","ordinal":314594,"en":"Their cries loud enough to shatter heads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l013","ordinal":314595,"en":"Roared, “Where is the enemy?”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l014","ordinal":314596,"en":"And challenged, “Come out in single combat!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l015","ordinal":314597,"en":"Gripping battle-axes, they made ready;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l016","ordinal":314598,"en":"Whichever one you looked at"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l017","ordinal":314599,"en":"Swayed as if eager to grapple."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l018","ordinal":314600,"en":"They brandished unsheathed swords"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l019","ordinal":314601,"en":"And merely gnashed apart"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l020","ordinal":314602,"en":"Their shovel-like teeth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l021","ordinal":314603,"en":"They bounded like tigers,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l022","ordinal":314604,"en":"As though none who fought them could survive."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l023","ordinal":314605,"en":"The sixty mighty caravan men"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l024","ordinal":314606,"en":"Brandished their lances,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l025","ordinal":314607,"en":"And swung their crescent-bladed axes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l026","ordinal":314608,"en":"They thrust forward their cast-iron mace heads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l027","ordinal":314609,"en":"Swaggering and working themselves into a fury."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l028","ordinal":314610,"en":"Toward Seytek, who stood grieving,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l029","ordinal":314611,"en":"They came calling him a bandit;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l030","ordinal":314612,"en":"The strongmen were approaching"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l031","ordinal":314613,"en":"As though to lash and beat him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l032","ordinal":314614,"en":"Their words vile, their faces grim,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l033","ordinal":314615,"en":"As though they would destroy him utterly."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l034","ordinal":314616,"en":"Those hulking brutes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l035","ordinal":314617,"en":"Those boundlessly insolent thugs,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l036","ordinal":314618,"en":"If left to their own devices,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l037","ordinal":314619,"en":"Looked ready to mow down and seize everything."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l038","ordinal":314620,"en":"The lumbering caravan men"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l039","ordinal":314621,"en":"Had hell showing in their faces,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b002:l040","ordinal":314622,"en":"Intent on stirring every kind of quarrel."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b003:l001","ordinal":314623,"en":"My tunic, blue-mottled as a lake,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0266:b003:l002","ordinal":314624,"en":"She had torn open and cast aside;"}]
